   "part": "Sprechen T3",
   "de": "Vielen Dank für deine Präsentation. Ich fand sie sehr interessant.",
   "en": "Thank you for your presentation. I found it very interesting."
  },
  {
   "function": "Ask politely what interests you",
   "part": "Sprechen T3",
   "de": "Mich würde interessieren, ob / wie / warum [Satz]",
   "en": "I would be interested to know whether / how / why [clause]"
  },
